  {
    "id": "dialogue-log-screenshot-dinner",
    "source": "<b>Irma:</b> <indent=16%>Dinner is served.</indent>\n<b>Gertrude:</b> <indent=16%>Irma, this is wonderful, as always, my dear.</indent>\n<b>Irma:</b> <indent=16%>Of course, love.</indent>\n<b>Claudius:</b> <indent=16%>Yes, many thanks, Irma. You've made my wife a happier—and plumper—woman during these hard times.</indent>\n<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>...</indent>\n<b>Gertrude:</b> <indent=16%>Aren't you hungry?</indent>\n<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>My appetite fails me. Perhaps it's just a stench on the wind, blowing in from the graveyard.</indent>\n<b>Gertrude:</b> <indent=16%>Oh, Hamlet.</indent>\n<b>Irma:</b> <indent=16%>(Idiot.)</indent>\n<b>Claudius:</b> <indent=16%>Enough. Sit up straight. Look at your mother when you speak to her.</indent>\n<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>Or <i>what</i>?</indent>\n<b>Claudius:</b> <indent=16%>Or I'll have to teach you discipline at the tip of my blade.</indent>\n<b>Hamlet:</b> <indent=16%>You ought to have sent me away when you had the chance.",
    "target": "<b>伊尔玛:</b> <indent=16%>晚餐已经备好了。</indent>\n<b>乔特鲁德:</b> <indent=16%>伊尔玛，亲爱的，这饭菜一如既往地美味。</indent>\n<b>伊尔玛:</b> <indent=16%>那当然，亲爱的。</indent>\n<b>克劳狄斯:</b> <indent=16%>是啊，多谢你，伊尔玛。在这段艰难的日子里，你让我妻子更开心了——也更丰腴了。</indent>\n<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>...</indent>\n<b>乔特鲁德:</b> <indent=16%>你不饿吗？</indent>\n<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>我没胃口。也许只是风里有股恶臭，从墓地吹来的。</indent>\n<b>乔特鲁德:</b> <indent=16%>唉，哈姆雷特。</indent>\n<b>伊尔玛:</b> <indent=16%>（蠢货。）</indent>\n<b>克劳狄斯:</b> <indent=16%>够了。坐直。跟你母亲说话时，看着她。</indent>\n<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>不然<i>怎样</i>？</indent>\n<b>克劳狄斯:</b> <indent=16%>不然，我就得用剑尖教你守规矩了。</indent>\n<b>哈姆雷特:</b> <indent=16%>你当初有机会的时候，就该把我送走。",
    "source_sha256": "fecea8f36dddec6904d0a696206177bfe787cc15e1b3af55ef40fa95c0a4d663",
    "target_sha256": "b0e6355a6cd213797832e479acd6f5e24c247a0f3ab85910e430178dca69f085",
