    "id": "dialogue-log-screenshot-court",
    "source": "<b>Claudius:</b> <indent=16%>There may be more to this than mere lovesickness.</indent>\n<b>Polonius:</b> <indent=16%>What do you mean by that?</indent>\n<b>Claudius:</b> <indent=16%>You and I should meet to discuss this further, privately. Perhaps tomorrow. In the meantime, Lady Ophelia, I urge you to stay away from Hamlet.</indent>\n<b>Polonius:</b> <indent=16%>Of course, my lord.",
    "target": "<b>克劳狄斯:</b> <indent=16%>这件事可能不只是相思病那么简单。</indent>\n<b>波洛涅斯:</b> <indent=16%>您这话是什么意思？</indent>\n<b>克劳狄斯:</b> <indent=16%>你我应该私下见面，再仔细谈谈这件事。也许就明天吧。在那之前，奥菲莉娅小姐，我劝你离哈姆雷特远些。</indent>\n<b>波洛涅斯:</b> <indent=16%>当然，陛下。",
